      en: "Atlas Foothills is a remarkable feature of the geography and culture of Morocco. Gentle hills at the foot of the High Atlas. Transition zone. Traditional villages. This landform shapes the topography of Morocco. Like many notable places in Morocco, it combines regional character with wider significance. Thus, this place contributes to the diverse profile of Morocco."
