      en: "High Plateaus is a remarkable feature of the geography and culture of Morocco. Dry plateaus in the east. Semi-desert climate. Large areas. This landform shapes the topography of Morocco. Like many notable places in Morocco, it combines regional character with wider significance. Thus, this place contributes to the diverse profile of Morocco."
